{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜跟進宏福苑報告(三)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-10-30-13-04-08ShqaorFI.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：跟進宏福苑報告</p><p>政府公布宏福苑火災獨立委員會報告，並提出一系列問責及改革措施。這些措施的力度是否足夠？能否防止類似事件再次發生？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>香港測量師學會建築測量組主席黎嘉文</p><p>立法會議員(選舉委員會)林筱魯</p><p></p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:05:27.981587+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:17.009293+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:59:58.552844+00:00","content_hash":"3802a2b384d04b8d2fe736844cab01722a8436018786a8ad79b07ccc9413e99c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:05:27.981587+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}